    "name": "luh-hytowering",
    "notes": "This data is a selection of the downsampled acceleration data from the large-scale segemented concrete tower in the span field under ambient excitation for various preload levels. The data was used for the publication \"Influence of system changes on closely spaced modes of a large-scale concrete tower for the application to Structural Health Monitoring\" is published in the Springer Journal of Civil Structural Health Monitoring (https://doi.org/10.1007/s13349-023-00693-6).\r\nThe experimental setup is described in this publication.",
